    "text": "I, Dayasiri Jayasekara the Minister of Sports by virtue of powers vested in me under Sections 32(b) and 33 of the SportsAct No. 25 of 1973 do hereby suspend the registration of Sri Lanka Badminton Association, the National Association forBadminton and as a interim arrangement appoint Mr. Samasundara Ekanayake Rajawardene Tennakoon MudiyanselageSaman Priyantha Bandara, Director General of the Department of Sports Development as its competent authority witheffect from 19.04.2017 to continue its functions and further order that the election be convened and held to elect newoffice bearers to the Sri Lanka Badminton Association for 2017.",
